**Create/ Edit users profile: **\
You would need to:\
\
Include the information of users:\
\
Avatar (required)\
\
Name (required)\
\
DOB (required)\
\
Position (required)\
\
Bio (optional)\
\
List of highlight images (required)\
\
Status (active or not active) toggle field. Default shows active status.\
\
Users can edit data\
\
Validate fields\
\
Disable the \'93Save\'94 button when missing any required fields\
